Port the covering tests from vitest to bun:test.

Mechanical: the runner import, vi.fn to mock, the hoisted vi.mock blocks
to mock.module plus a deferred import, toHaveBeenCalledOnce to
toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1), and one cast where bun infers a narrower mock
return type than vitest did. client.test.ts takes the narrowed env type
from patch 0001. triage-workspace.test.ts drops two cases that read
skills/triage markdown, which is not vendored; the file records why and
what must be reproduced against our own skill.

tests/queue-coordinator.test.ts is NOT in this patch: it is a rewrite
against a local subclass, recorded as derived in PROVENANCE.md.

